config OPENCORE_AAC
	bool "OpenCORE AAC decoder"
	help
	  Fixed-point AAC-LC / HE-AAC decoder of the OpenCORE multimedia
	  framework (west project modules/lib/opencore, Apache-2.0). Integer
	  only, no libm. The decoder sources are C written in .cpp files and are
	  built as C.
